  "english": [
    "<b>and</b> there was <b>a cracked roofing placed atop</b> the two houses. If the roofing was intact it would have the legal status of a tent over a corpse, rendering everything in the alleyway, and, through the windows, everything in the houses, ritually impure. However, since the roofing was cracked and the corpse was directly beneath the opening, if the opening was the size of a handbreadth or more, the entire alleyway and the houses would not become impure. Only the area directly over the corpse extending through the opening is impure. <b>And</b> that is the reason that <b>they sealed the window</b> of the house <b>with an earthenware vessel,</b> so that the ritual impurity would not enter the houses, <b>and they tied an earthenware shard with a</b> long <b>reed-grass</b> inserted into the opening in the roofing in order <b>to ascertain whether or not there is an opening there in the roofing the size of a handbreadth.</b>",
    "The mishna concludes: <b>And from their statements</b> and their actions, <b>we derived that one may seal</b> a window, <b>and measure, and tie</b> a knot <b>on Shabbat.</b> The Gemara relates: <b>Ulla happened</b> to come <b>to the house of the Exilarch. He saw Rabba bar Rav Huna sitting in a tub [<i>avna</i>] of water and measuring it.</b> He <b>said to</b> Rabba bar Rav Huna: <b>Say that the Sages said</b> that it is permitted to measure on Shabbat only <b>a measurement for a mitzva.</b> However, with regard to a measurement like this one, <b>which is not</b> for <b>a mitzva, did they say</b> that it is permitted? Rabba bar Rav Huna <b>said to him: I am merely acting unawares</b> and am not at all interested in the measurements. Therefore, it is not prohibited."
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְגִיגִית סְדוּקָה מוּנַּחַת עַל גַּבָּן. וּפָקְקוּ אֶת",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הַמָּאוֹר בַּטָּפִיחַ, וְקָשְׁרוּ <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>אֶת הַמְּקִידָּה בְּגֶמִי",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לֵידַע אִם יֵשׁ שָׁם בְּגִיגִית פּוֹתֵחַ טֶפַח אִם לָאו<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"1089\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"824\" data-sentence-id=\"1\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וּמִדִּבְרֵיהֶם לָמַדְנוּ שֶׁפּוֹקְקִין וּמוֹדְדִין וְקוֹשְׁרִין",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "בְּשַׁבָּת<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"1090\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Ulla, second and third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2409\" data-full-name=\"Ulla\" data-name-he=\"עולא נחותא\">עוּלָּא</span> אִיקְּלַע לְבֵי רֵישׁ גָּלוּתָא.",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "חַזְיֵיהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabba bar Rav Huna, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2596\" data-full-name=\"Rabba bar Rav Huna\" data-name-he=\"רבה בר רב הונא\">לְרַבָּה בַּר רַב הוּנָא</span> דְּיָתֵיב בְּאַוּוֹנָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דְמַיָּא וְקָא מָשַׁח לֵיהּ. אֲמַר לֵיהּ: אֵימַר",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"1\" data-marker-letter=\"ב\">ב</span>דְּאָמְרִי רַבָּנַן מְדִידָה דְמִצְוָה, דְּלָאו מִצְוָה מִי",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֲמוּר? אֲמַר לֵיהּ: מִתְעַסֵּק בְּעָלְמָא אֲנָא<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"1091\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><br><br><big><strong>הדרן עלך מי שהחשיך וסליקא לה מסכת שבת</strong></big><br><br>",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rashi": [
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "<b>וְגִיגִית סְדוּקָה מוּנַּחַת עַל <span class=\"dh-divergent\">גביו</span>.</b> והמת מוטל בהילקטי תחת הגיגית [כנגד] הסדק ולפני מות המת פקקו בשבת המאור בטפיח שמא אין",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "בסדק הגיגית פותח טפח ונמצא המת מוטל באהל שאין לו מקום לצאת דרך מעלה וחור שבין שני בתים מכניס את הטומאה לצד שני",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "במלא אגרוף לפיכך סתמוהו בכלי חרס וגבו כנגד ההילקט וכלי חרס אינו מטמא מגבו וחוצץ: <b>וְקָשְׁרוּ <span class=\"dh-divergent\">מקידה</span></b> שהיא רחבה טפח: <b>בגמי</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "<b>לֵידַע.</b> אם תכנס בסדק הגיגית ובמסכת אהלות (פ\"י) שנינו (דאין) חילוק בארובה שבתוך הבית וטומאה מקצתה כנגד ארובה ומקצתה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "בתוך הבית בין יש בארובה פותח",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "טפח לאין בארובה פותח טפח ואני",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "לא יכולתי להבין בו ולהכי נקט גמי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "שראוי למאכל בהמה ולא מיבטל",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "ליה להיות קשר של קיימא דמנתק",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "כשיבש: <b>בְּאַוּוֹנָא</b> בגיגית מלאה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "מים: <b>מִתְעַסֵּק.</b> שלא לצורך אלא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "0px",
      "text": "לאיעסוקי בעלמא:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Shabbat 157b:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
